<title>USA: Northrop Grumman gets $6 mln contract.</title>
<headline>Northrop Grumman gets $6 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northrop Grumman Corp said on Friday it won a $6 million contract from Serco Group Plc of Great Britain for self-propelled acoustic targets to be used by the Royal Navy.</p>
<p>The three autonomous mobile underwater targets, operational support equipment and spares will be provided by Northrop's anti-submarine warfare unit, based in Cleveland.</p>
